  "title": "Career Seed Grant A Step Towards Academic Independence",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "At the request of the Vice President Research and Corporate Relations, the Executive Board has established the ETH Zurich Career Seed Grant as of 1 March 2016.\n\nThe new ETH funding instrument will give postdoctoral researchers at ETH Zurich the opportunity to independently conduct their own research project alongside their tasks in the research group of their professorship.\n\nThose interested in applying for a Career Seed Grant should note the following:\n\nSubmissions deadlines for a Career Seed Grant: 1 March 2016 and 1 September 2016.\n\nFurther information: www.seedprojects.ethz.ch (with guidelines and contact information)."
    }
